 from 1 November because it's summer.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
 But since there is a 12-year period,

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
 in fact, it's to reevaluate compared to the use.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
 So, in this moment, it's being analyzed,

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
 but I really want to say and say it to several times,

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
 that we understand the need to keep an installation structurally

12
